Collecting items is automatic, you just 
need to enter the field where they are  
located. Hourglasses, shields and maps  
do not disappear from the map, they can 
be collected several times, but only    
one can be carried. The sword can only  
be picked up once and disappears after  
use (killing the bat).                  
                                        
         Game by New Generation         
                                        
         Code              dely         
       Soundtrack         Tatqoo        
                                        
     First shown at Last Party 2024     
                                        
             Party version              
                                        
     PRESS ANY KEY FOR TITLE SCREEN      